    {
      "source": "Subscribe to one or more <a href=\"Topic.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.listener\"><code>Topic</code></a>s and receive a stream of <a href=\"../connection/ReactiveSubscription.ChannelMessage.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>ReactiveSubscription.ChannelMessage</code></a>.",
      "translation": "订阅一个或多个<a href=\"Topic.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.listener 中的接口\"><code>Topic</code></a>，即可接收<code>ReactiveSubscription.ChannelMessage</code><a href=\"../connection/ReactiveSubscription.ChannelMessage.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.connection 中的类\"></a>流。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/InvalidDataAccessApiUsageException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.dao\">InvalidDataAccessApiUsageException</a></code> - if <code>patternTopics</code> is empty.",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/InvalidDataAccessApiUsageException.html\" title=\"org.springframework.dao 中的类或接口\">InvalidDataAccessApiUsageException</a></code> - 如果 <code>patternTopics</code> 为空。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/InvalidDataAccessApiUsageException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.dao\">InvalidDataAccessApiUsageException</a></code> - if <code>topics</code> is empty.",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/InvalidDataAccessApiUsageException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.dao\">InvalidDataAccessApiUsageException</a></code> - 如果 <code>topics</code> 为空。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "The returned <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a> completes once the connection has been subscribed to the given <a href=\"Topic.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.listener\"><code>topics</code></a>. Note\nthat cancelling the returned <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a> can leave the connection in a subscribed state.",
      "translation": "返回的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a> 会在订阅给定的 <a href=\"Topic.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.listener\"><code>topics</code></a> 的连接完成后完成。请注意，取消返回的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a> 可能会使连接处于已订阅状态。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Subscribe to one or more <a href=\"Topic.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.listener\"><code>Topic</code></a>s and receive a stream of <a href=\"../connection/ReactiveSubscription.ChannelMessage.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>ReactiveSubscription.ChannelMessage</code></a>. The stream may contain\n<a href=\"../connection/ReactiveSubscription.PatternMessage.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>ReactiveSubscription.PatternMessage</code></a> if subscribed to patterns. Messages, and channel names are serialized/deserialized using the\ngiven <code>channelSerializer</code> and <code>messageSerializer</code>. The message stream subscribes lazily to the Redis\nchannels and unsubscribes if the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.4-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Subscription.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Subscription</code></a> is\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.4-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Subscription.html#cancel()\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>cancelled</code></a>.",
      "translation": "订阅一个或多个 <a href=\"Topic.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.listener 中的接口\"><code>Topic</code></a>，即可接收 <a href=\"../connection/ReactiveSubscription.ChannelMessage.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.connection 中的类\"><code>ReactiveSubscription.ChannelMessage</code></a> 的流。如果订阅了模式（patterns），该流还可能包含 <a href=\"../connection/ReactiveSubscription.PatternMessage.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.connection 中的类\"><code>ReactiveSubscription.PatternMessage</code></a>。消息和频道名称将使用给定的 <code>channelSerializer</code> 和 <code>messageSerializer</code> 进行序列化/反序列化。消息流会懒式地订阅 Redis 频道，并在 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.4-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Subscription.html\" title=\"org.reactivestreams 中的类或接口\"><code>Subscription</code></a> 被\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.4-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Subscription.html#cancel()\" title=\"org.reactivestreams 中的类或接口\"><code>cancelled</code></a> 时取消订阅。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"ReactiveRedisMessageListenerContainer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.listener\"><code>ReactiveRedisMessageListenerContainer</code></a> given <a href=\"../connection/ReactiveRedisConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>ReactiveRedisConnectionFactory</code></a>.",
      "translation": "根据 <a href=\"../connection/ReactiveRedisConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"接口在 org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>ReactiveRedisConnectionFactory</code></a> 创建一个新的 <a href=\"ReactiveRedisMessageListenerContainer.html\" title=\"类在 org.springframework.data.redis.listener\"><code>ReactiveRedisMessageListenerContainer</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
