    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Note the container allocates a single connection when it is created and releases the connection on\n<a href=\"#destroy()\"><code>destroy()</code></a>. Connections are allocated eagerly to not interfere with non-blocking use during application\noperations. Using reactive infrastructure allows usage of a single connection due to channel multiplexing.",
      "translation": "容器在创建时分配单个连接，并在调用<a href=\"#destroy()\"><code>destroy()</code></a>时释放该连接。为避免干扰应用程序操作期间的非阻塞使用，连接采用急切分配策略。借助反应式基础设施的通道多路复用功能，仅需一个连接即可满足需求。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "This class is thread-safe and allows subscription by multiple concurrent threads.",
      "translation": "该类是线程安全的，允许多个并发线程进行订阅。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Subscribe to one or more <a href=\"Topic.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.listener\"><code>Topic</code></a>s and receive a stream of <a href=\"../connection/ReactiveSubscription.ChannelMessage.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>ReactiveSubscription.ChannelMessage</code></a>. The stream may contain\n<a href=\"../connection/ReactiveSubscription.PatternMessage.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>ReactiveSubscription.PatternMessage</code></a> if subscribed to patterns. Messages, and channel names are serialized/deserialized using the\ngiven <code>channelSerializer</code> and <code>messageSerializer</code>. The message stream subscribes lazily to the Redis\nchannels and unsubscribes if the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.4-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Subscription.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Subscription</code></a> is\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.4-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Subscription.html#cancel()\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>cancelled</code></a>. <a href=\"../connection/SubscriptionListener.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>SubscriptionListener</code></a> is notified upon\nsubscription/unsubscription and can be used for synchronization.",
      "translation": "订阅一个或多个<a href=\"Topic.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.listener 中的接口\"><code>Topic</code></a>，即可接收由<a href=\"../connection/ReactiveSubscription.ChannelMessage.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.connection 中的类\"><code>ReactiveSubscription.ChannelMessage</code></a>组成的消息流。如果订阅了模式（patterns），该流中还可能包含<a href=\"../connection/ReactiveSubscription.PatternMessage.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.connection 中的类\"><code>ReactiveSubscription.PatternMessage</code></a>。消息和频道名称的序列化与反序列化由给定的<code>channelSerializer</code>和<code>messageSerializer</code>处理。消息流会懒式地订阅 Redis 频道，并在<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.4-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Subscription.html\" title=\"org.reactivestreams 中的类或接口\"><code>Subscription</code></a>被<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.4-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Subscription.html#cancel()\" title=\"org.reactivestreams 中的类或接口\"><code>cancelled</code></a>时取消订阅。<a href=\"../connection/SubscriptionListener.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.connection 中的接口\"><code>SubscriptionListener</code></a>会在订阅/取消订阅时被通知，可用于同步操作。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Subscribe to one or more <a href=\"ChannelTopic.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.listener\"><code>ChannelTopic</code></a>s and receive a stream of <a href=\"../connection/ReactiveSubscription.ChannelMessage.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>ReactiveSubscription.ChannelMessage</code></a>. Messages and channel\nnames are treated as <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>. The message stream subscribes lazily to the Redis channels and unsubscribes if\nthe <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.4-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Subscription.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Subscription</code></a> is <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.4-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Subscription.html#cancel()\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>cancelled</code></a>.",
      "translation": "订阅一个或多个 <a href=\"ChannelTopic.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.listener\"><code>ChannelTopic</code></a>，即可接收 <a href=\"../connection/ReactiveSubscription.ChannelMessage.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>ReactiveSubscription.ChannelMessage</code></a> 的消息流。消息和频道名称均被视为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>。该消息流会懒式订阅 Redis 频道，并在 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.4-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Subscription.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Subscription</code></a> 被 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.4-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Subscription.html#cancel()\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>cancelled</code></a> 时取消订阅。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Subscribe to one or more <a href=\"PatternTopic.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.listener\"><code>PatternTopic</code></a>s and receive a stream of <a href=\"../connection/ReactiveSubscription.PatternMessage.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>ReactiveSubscription.PatternMessage</code></a>. Messages, pattern,\nand channel names are treated as <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>. The message stream subscribes lazily to the Redis channels and\nunsubscribes if the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.4-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Subscription.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Subscription</code></a> is <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.4-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Subscription.html#cancel()\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>cancelled</code></a>.",
      "translation": "订阅一个或多个<a href=\"PatternTopic.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.listener\"><code>PatternTopic</code></a>，即可接收<code>ReactiveSubscription.PatternMessage</code>的消息流。消息、模式及频道名称均被视为<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>类型。该消息流会懒式订阅 Redis 频道，并在<code>Subscription</code>被<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.4-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Subscription.html#cancel()\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>cancelled</code></a>时取消订阅。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Subscribe to one or more <a href=\"Topic.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.listener\"><code>Topic</code></a>s and receive a stream of <a href=\"../connection/ReactiveSubscription.ChannelMessage.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>ReactiveSubscription.ChannelMessage</code></a>. The returned <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a>\ncompletes once the connection has been subscribed to the given <a href=\"Topic.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.listener\"><code>topics</code></a>. Note that cancelling the\nreturned <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a> can leave the connection in a subscribed state.",
      "translation": "订阅一个或多个 <a href=\"Topic.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.listener 中的接口\"><code>Topic</code></a>，并接收 <a href=\"../connection/ReactiveSubscription.ChannelMessage.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.connection 中的类\"><code>ReactiveSubscription.ChannelMessage</code></a> 流。返回的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"reactor.core.publisher 中的类或接口\"><code>Mono</code></a>\n将在已订阅给定的 <a href=\"Topic.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.listener 中的接口\"><code>topics</code></a> 的连接完成后完成。请注意，取消返回的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"reactor.core.publisher 中的类或接口\"><code>Mono</code></a> 可能会导致连接仍处于订阅状态。",
