      "source": "the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a> signalling container termination.",
      "translation": "发出容器终止信号的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>connectionFactory</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>connectionFactory</code> 不能为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Mark Paluch, Christoph Strobl",
      "translation": "Mark Paluch，Christoph Strobl",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Container providing a stream of <a href=\"../connection/ReactiveSubscription.ChannelMessage.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>ReactiveSubscription.ChannelMessage</code></a> for messages received via Redis Pub/Sub listeners. The stream\nis infinite and registers Redis subscriptions. Handles the low level details of listening, converting and message\ndispatching.",
      "translation": "提供通过 Redis Pub/Sub 监听器接收的消息的 <a href=\"../connection/ReactiveSubscription.ChannelMessage.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>ReactiveSubscription.ChannelMessage</code></a> 流。该流是无限的，并注册 Redis 订阅。它处理监听、转换和消息分发的底层细节。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Subscribe to one or more <a href=\"ChannelTopic.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.listener\"><code>ChannelTopic</code></a>s and receive a stream of <a href=\"../connection/ReactiveSubscription.ChannelMessage.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>ReactiveSubscription.ChannelMessage</code></a> once the returned\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a> completes. Messages and channel names are treated as <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>. The message stream subscribes\nlazily to the Redis channels and unsubscribes if the inner <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.4-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Subscription.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Subscription</code></a> is\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.4-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Subscription.html#cancel()\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>cancelled</code></a>.",
      "translation": "订阅一个或多个 <a href=\"ChannelTopic.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.listener\"><code>ChannelTopic</code></a>，并在返回的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a> 完成后接收 <a href=\"../connection/ReactiveSubscription.ChannelMessage.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>ReactiveSubscription.ChannelMessage</code></a> 的消息流。消息和频道名称均被视为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>。该消息流会懒式订阅 Redis 频道，并在内部 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.4-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Subscription.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Subscription</code></a> 被 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.4-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Subscription.html#cancel()\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>cancelled</code></a> 时取消订阅。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Subscribe to one or more <a href=\"PatternTopic.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.listener\"><code>PatternTopic</code></a>s and receive a stream of <a href=\"../connection/ReactiveSubscription.PatternMessage.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>ReactiveSubscription.PatternMessage</code></a> once the returned\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a> completes. Messages, pattern, and channel names are treated as <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>. The message stream\nsubscribes lazily to the Redis channels and unsubscribes if the inner <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.4-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Subscription.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Subscription</code></a> is\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.4-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Subscription.html#cancel()\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>cancelled</code></a>.",
      "translation": "订阅一个或多个 <a href=\"PatternTopic.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.listener\"><code>PatternTopic</code></a>，并在返回的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a> 完成后接收 <a href=\"../connection/ReactiveSubscription.PatternMessage.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>ReactiveSubscription.PatternMessage</code></a> 的消息流。消息、模式和通道名称均被视为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>。该消息流会懒订阅 Redis 通道，并在内部 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.4-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Subscription.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Subscription</code></a> 被 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.4-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Subscription.html#cancel()\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>cancelled</code></a> 时取消订阅。",
      "count": 1
    }
  ]
}